        "original_id": "03f40e24-75d2-5153-ba9c-15034ad5e3a9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: the SS-owned company, Heinrich Hoffmann’s publishing business\n- Organizations: a Nazi association\n- People: Adolf Hitler, Heinrich Hoffmann\n- Products: a reflector\n- Topics: Nazi racial policy, child welfare propaganda\n\nFacts:\n- Adolf Hitler’s chauffeur invented a reflector that was later marketed by an SS-owned company.\n- The SS-owned company funded a Nazi association that aimed to increase the birth and survival rate of children classified as “Aryan.”\n- Heinrich Hoffmann’s publishing business was associated with the reflector’s commercialization and Nazi propaganda networks.",
