        "original_id": "9df8249b-d0f9-5163-8287-677d663fe5cd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Anton Loibl GmbH\n- Organizations: SS, Ahnenerbe, Lebensborn e.V.\n- People: Anton Loibl, Adolf Hitler\n- Concepts: Nazi racial hygiene, eugenics\n\nFacts:\n- Anton Loibl GmbH was created to market a bicycle reflector invented by Anton Loibl, who was a chauffeur for Adolf Hitler.\n- Anton Loibl GmbH was a company owned by the SS.\n- Anton Loibl GmbH served as a funding source for the Ahnenerbe research branch and the Lebensborn eugenics programme.\n- Lebensborn e.V., meaning \"Fount of Life,\" was an SS-initiated, state-supported registered association in Nazi Germany.\n- Lebensborn e.V. aimed to raise the birth rate of \"Aryan\" children born to persons classified as racially pure and healthy under Nazi racial hygiene and health ideology.",
